  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct Imports of Fruit from Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nafreshco B.V. imports fruit directly from Peru and is creating a smaller supply chain through direct links between grower and retailer. Nafreshco works together with their local partner Agrocosta and provides support and trainings to outgrowers. Trainings are related to marketing, linking product to customer demands in Europe and gaining certifications for different fruits. With this TA support was given to gain Rainforest Alliance certification and to pre-finance shipments of 2 containers mandarins and minneolas. By these shipments 10 FTE have been supported during this project.</narrative>
  </description>
